# This project does not read a .env file. Secrets are file-based, under relay/:
#
# 1) relay/token.txt — the shared bridge token the panel and your agent send
#    as the `x-bridge-token` header. Generate it with:
#        openssl rand -hex 24 > relay/token.txt
#    The same value replaces the __BRIDGE_TOKEN__ placeholder in
#    addon/src/index.js at deploy time (see README → Setup).
#
# 2) relay/cert.pem and relay/key.pem — a TLS certificate for `localhost`
#    (its SAN must cover `localhost`). See README → Setup for a one-liner.
#
# Both are git-ignored. The relay binds to 127.0.0.1:8322 only; never expose
# it on a public interface.
